// A control message while scrolled up: like any arrival the list does not
// move; the message is a quiet line, never a bubble (docs/agent-on-strut.md,
// PR 1).
// needs: peer
// check: arrival hold=chat
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"scroll": 900}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "arrival", "for": 10}
{"signal": "peer-sends-control"}
{"wait": 9}
